# Frontend build-time configuration. Copy to `.env` for local `npm run dev`.
#
# Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed variable into the bundle that ships to the
# browser, so NOTHING SECRET GOES HERE — no JWT secret, no database URL, no
# admin key (frontend/AGENTS.md, Gotchas).

# The API Gateway (ai/decisions.md D-010): the ONE URL the browser needs.
# Port 8080 is provisional (D-018).
#
# Empty runs the app on fixtures — no gateway, no real accounts, and the
# suppliers screens will report that no gateway is configured. Set it to point
# at a running gateway for the real flow:
#
#   VITE_GATEWAY_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8080
#
# Use localhost, not the Compose service name: the BROWSER resolves this, and
# it runs on the host, not inside the Compose network.
VITE_GATEWAY_BASE_URL=
